# The media in GameData are binary files (Design/ADR/ADR-004). The root rule `* text=auto` would
# usually tell them apart by their NUL bytes; saying so outright means no normalization can ever
# rewrite a byte of one. Git LFS pointer files that have not been replaced yet are small text
# files, and are stored byte for byte all the same.
*.bin  binary
*.ico  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.otf  binary
*.png  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.wav  binary
